### ===============================
### PARENTS
### ===============================

### Create parent
POST http://localhost:8080/parents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smith"
}

###

### Create another parent
POST http://localhost:8080/parents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Johnson"
}

###

### Get all parents (collection read)
GET http://localhost:8080/parents

###

### Get single parent by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/parents/29ffaf54-e72a-4ab3-994c-8ed37b1056c7

###

### Update parent
PUT http://localhost:8080/parents/799a0f3d-bac0-4007-8a9b-1bfce3b25f6c
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smith Updated"
}

###

### Delete parent (cascade deletes children)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/parents/29ffaf54-e72a-4ab3-994c-8ed37b1056c7

###

### Delete non-existent parent
DELETE http://localhost:8080/parents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### Create child for parent
POST http://localhost:8080/parents/0ce135ba-6567-4f71-815f-7e3c3a825d3f/children
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John"
}

###

### Create another child for parent
POST http://localhost:8080/parents/0ce135ba-6567-4f71-815f-7e3c3a825d3f/children
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Emma"
}

###

### Get all children of parent
GET http://localhost:8080/parents/0ce135ba-6567-4f71-815f-7e3c3a825d3f/children

###

### Get single child of parent
GET http://localhost:8080/parents/2b6da6a7-f2af-4ddd-a547-051e08760c28/children/42e3139e-77bd-43c3-9c2c-8614da713376

###

### Update child
PUT http://localhost:8080/parents/0ce135ba-6567-4f71-815f-7e3c3a825d3f/children/42e3139e-77bd-43c3-9c2c-8614da713376
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Updated"
}

###

### Delete child
DELETE http://localhost:8080/parents/0ce135ba-6567-4f71-815f-7e3c3a825d3f/children/42e3139e-77bd-43c3-9c2c-8614da713376

###